<span id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1757534895093_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_linked_image" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="linked_image"><a href="https://creativitybenchmark.ai/" target="_parent" id="hs-link-widget_1757534895093_" style="border-width:0px;border:0px;"><img src="https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=450&amp;height=161&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png" class="hs-image-widget " width="450" height="161" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;" alt="Creativity Benchmark" title="Creativity Benchmark" srcset="https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=225&amp;height=81&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 225w, https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=450&amp;height=161&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 450w, https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=675&amp;height=242&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 675w, https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=900&amp;height=322&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 900w, https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=1125&amp;height=403&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 1125w, https://info.springboards.ai/hs-fs/hubfs/Creativity%20Benchmark.png?width=1350&amp;height=483&amp;name=Creativity%20Benchmark.png 1350w" sizes="(max-width: 450px) 100vw, 450px"></a></span></div>

