<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-3 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1757534905147" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><span id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1757534905147_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><div title="Page 1">
<div>
<div>
<h2 style="line-height: 1; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 30px;"><span style="font-family: Halyard;"><span style="font-weight: 900;">Breaking the Benchmark: Findings From </span></span><span style="font-family: Halyard;"><span style="font-weight: 900;"></span>the Industry’s First LLM Creativity Study </span></span></h2>
</div>
</div>
</div></span></div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-4 dnd_area-row-1-padding dnd-section dnd_area-row-1-background-image dnd_area-row-1-background-layers">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" style="" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" data-w="12">

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-5 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1757537298443" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module widget-type-rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module"><span id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1757537298443_" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_rich_text" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="rich_text"><p data-pm-slice="1 1 []"><span style="font-size: 18px;">We’ve just completed the world’s first benchmark of LLM creativity in advertising. Our industry-sourced benchmark tested 16&nbsp;leading models across thousands of head-to-head comparisons. The findings show there’s no single “best” model and that human instinct and variation still matter most.</span></p></span></div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-6 dnd_area-row-2-background-layers dnd_area-row-2-padding dnd-section dnd_area-row-2-background-image">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" style="" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" data-w="12">

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-7 cell_1757535375175-row-0-margin cell_1757535375175-row-0-vertical-alignment dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-cell cell_1760625128051-vertical-alignment dnd-column" style="" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" data-w="12">

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-8 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_widget_1760625127900" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">












  





  
  












<div class="button-wrapper">
  
    <a class="button    " href="#">
      
  
  What we learned

    </a>
  
</div></div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-9 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span6 widget-span widget-type-cell dnd-column" style="" data-widget-type="cell" data-x="0" data-w="6">

<div class="row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-10 dnd-row">
<div class="row-fluid ">
<div class="span12 widget-span widget-type-custom_widget dnd-module" style="" data-widget-type="custom_widget" data-x="0" data-w="12">
<div id="hs_cos_wrapper_module_17575353751759" class="hs_cos_wrapper hs_cos_wrapper_widget hs_cos_wrapper_type_module" style="" data-hs-cos-general-type="widget" data-hs-cos-type="module">














  <ul class="list">


  

  
    <li class="list__item">

      

      

      

      <div class="list__content">
        <h3>No clear model winner.</h3>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p>Model rankings shift by brand, culture, and task. </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      </div>

    </li>
  
    <li class="list__item">

      

      

      

      <div class="list__content">
        <h3>LLMs aren’t good judges.</h3>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p>Machines showed strong bias toward reasoning models and&nbsp;were 5–10× more confident than humans </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      </div>

    </li>
  
    <li class="list__item">

      

      

      

      <div class="list__content">
        <h3>Variance matters.</h3>
<div>
<div>
<div>
<p>Some models deliver broader creative spread than others </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
      </div>

    </li>
  
    <li class="list__item">

      

      

      

      <div class="list__content">
        <h3>Best practice</h3>
<p>Use models for volume, humans for selection</p>
      </div>

    </li>
  

  </ul>
</div>

</div><!--end widget-span -->
</div><!--end row-->
</div><!--end row-wrapper -->

</div><!--end widget-span -->
